    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i keep thinking about how everything is eventually just going to turn to dust. like, even the stars. if the heat death of the universe is inevitable and everything we do is just a temporary blip in an empty void, does any of this actually matter? it feels like we're all just performing this exhausting act of \"living\" for no reason at all.",
